        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Nggaaaaah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Aahh... aaaaaahh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah...! You... ngh...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that fire your doing!? You're the one who set them alight... guh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alina, I'm sorry. This will surely mean even worse to come for the village. But I just couldn't stand it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just couldn't stand this sort of...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Alina?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Facing her, Talulah was taken aback. Alina met her gaze with an expression she'd never seen her wear before."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a fire in your eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew from the moment you came to this village, you'd never be willing just to stay here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "You came from somewhere. Where you came from, you'll go back to. This village can't hold you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't go back. Don't look at me like that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "But within your eyes, truly, there's a fire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "You wanted to set something alight, burn it away, you thought none of this was how it should be, you bore it until you could bear it no more...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "It shouldn't have been now, Talulah. Not now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "The villagers are innocent. Your one flare of anger only served to hurt them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened\u2014oh, God! What the hell is going on?! Who!? Who did this!?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah! Talulah! Run, now, run! And don't look back! Don't ever come back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blessings, your Majesty, bless this girl like my daughter, bless her to live on, bless her so she can live on!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah, we need to go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... those hideous patrolmen!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're Infected, but none of the villagers are!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What did you say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm Infected too, Talulah. I'm Infected too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_snow_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Pant*, *pant*... This is... where we'd planned to move. We had everything ready... but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They... The old man was...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't let them do this again... we can't let them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He saved you, saved me, saved the whole village.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "You threw... his whole plan into disarray.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you even mean? The villagers were the ones who\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Wait. You mean the one who turned him in... was...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It was his idea. That way, the Patrol wouldn't come again, and hopefully, that would've been that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter how much strength you have, you can't resist the Patrol Unit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And then? What if the Gendarmerie came? What if the city's garrisons and all the nobles' soldiers came?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We just don't have the firepower. Once we've accumulated enough strength...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Because it's not right. It's not right! We can't just look on like this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "All these wicked things right before our eyes, but we turn away, just to save ourselves?! That's not right!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "...That's selfish. Heartless, even.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "If righteousness can only be upheld by greater and greater violence, how can it even be considered righteous?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't answer these questions of yours, Talulah. You've studied more than I have, that I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "But someone died today in the village. And no more ought to die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're so clever. You can understand that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, go, Talulah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'll be back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell yourself that, Talulah. Tell yourself that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
